WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.362
Four matches. How many papers?

00:00:40.362 --> 00:01:13.304
One source can produce very different indexes

00:01:13.304 --> 00:01:48.470
Fifty vectors stay fifty separate representations

00:01:48.470 --> 00:02:22.663
Related evidence can land in different chunks

00:02:22.663 --> 00:02:50.262
A stage can match only the evidence it indexes

00:02:50.262 --> 00:03:22.255
Retrieved text and supplied context can differ

00:03:22.255 --> 00:03:57.936
Grouping by source does not combine the argument

00:03:57.936 --> 00:04:31.100
Follow the evidence through four choices
